            "review_title": "Review at Hung Ky Mi Gia Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Mervyn33\nSingapore, Singapore353 contributions\n0\nDelicious Duck Noodle\nSep 2018 • Solo\nHung Ky Mi Gia offer quick and delicious Duck Soup Noodle, the set come with yellow egg noodle with some veggies with a generous piece of duck drumstick on top of the noodle .. they also provided some papaya salad. \nWith a can coke cola the bill was only 117 VND.\nApart from noodle they also have other items on their menu such rice and other cooked dishes.\nThe restaurant is nearby The Luxe Hotel\nRead more\nWritten September 19, 2018",
